    "evidence": [
      "Consolidate independent frozen owner outputs into one application verification batch, retaining original Font18ef task baseline and upstream master recovery commits after clean coordinator rebase. Existing signed Font source and strengthened tests remain unchanged.",
      "FameWin44A500 uses check()+1 !=0, matching original INC/JE; guarded native screen35/35 in actualOy- profile with unchanged replica, body damage and outside-function residual controls. Independent full-branch/Spot-return-domain review confirms no signed overflow on valid original paths. Only this FameWin body may change.",
      "Console4E13E0 moves initial signed MapArea snapshot, MapTiles load and counter before the guard, retaining live loop-bound reload and original prompts/restore/callback order. Guarded native screen improves45/59 to54/59 in actualOy- profile. Do not copy the rejected4E1300 source spelling, which regressed37/39 to23/39; keep its draft as ignored trial evidence, not production.",
      "Expand tests to execute actual FameWin hit/miss/sentinel/redraw paths and Console fungus prompt/error/nonpositive-area/reload/restore paths, including meaningful mutation controls. No flags, ABI changes beyond already authorized Font signatures, claim edits, safety fixes or other production changes.",
      "Workers are frozen; only coordinator copies exact selected hunks. Fresh combined compile/link, native Font ABI controls, source checks, current matching/reference and physical residual review precede integration. Manual checkpoint authority does not establish automatic/full-game acceptance."
    ],
